"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"08ab CRITICAL FINDING (Phase 4e validation): held-out oracle GREEN (27/27) + mutation teeth confirmed for grounding tools/index/optionality. BUT production plan-review tool-routing (AC6-AC7) is wired to the WRONG seam: subagent wired RunnerAgentStep.tool_provider via gate_dispatch.produce_plan_review_verdict, but ProductionBatchRunner.run() does 'del agent_runner' (intentionally unused) and drives run_pass1 -> sizing.pass1_with_ladder -> pass1_chunk with the plain Runner. Terraform tools are DEAD CODE on the live gate. Correct seam: thread a per-call T10-scoped Terraform tool set into RunRequest.extra_tools inside pass1_chunk (Runner appends req.extra_tools to agentic tool list at runner.py:434), minting+finalizing a session per T10 agentic call and folding usage into the read-set. pass1.py/passes.py were in file_impact but untouched. Re-dispatching subagent for the real fix + authoring held-out production-path oracle. NOT pushing 08ab until AC6-AC7 met on the live path.","timestamp":1788487558416071001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"08ab: pushed change 2603 for review. Commit 33aa240442ba (rebar-ticket 08ab-60d2-3082-4b47, DCO, Change-Id Ic51693e5). https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2603. Preflight: lint+typecheck clean (758 files); full held-out oracle GREEN (grounding tools/index 27 + production-wiring 5); mutation-teeth confirmed sandboxed on grounding tools, index, and the T10 pass1_tool_hook routing gate; 1051 plan_review+workflow regression GREEN; all AC verify GREEN. file_impact updated to accurate 30 paths. Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","timestamp":1788489342506591001}],"created_at":1788482466684642001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"503f380e-d45d-4bea-8196-87bdefc511f0","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"08ab-60d2-3082-4b47"}],"